我有个挺酷的东西要给你看。

2016
01:22:49.170 --> 01:22:54.530
They head down to the basement, way in the bottom of the building, and Ned's trying to guess where
他们朝地下室走去，一直走到大楼的最底层，内德开始猜

2017
01:22:54.530 --> 01:22:55.090
they're going.
他们要去哪里。

2018
01:22:55.310 --> 01:23:03.130
And then she opens the door, and in front of them, and it's so huge, is an old printing
然后她打开了门，在他们面前，那个庞然大物是一台旧

2019
01:23:03.130 --> 01:23:03.710
press.
印刷机。

2020
01:23:04.560 --> 01:23:04.870
Yeah.
没错。

2021
01:23:05.050 --> 01:23:09.590
She says, this is the original printing press, the thing you're seeing in this documentary.
她说，这就是最初的印刷机，也就是你在纪录片里看到的那台。

2022
01:23:09.990 --> 01:23:10.150
Yeah.
没错。

2023
01:23:10.830 --> 01:23:16.050
So Greg told me they filmed this scene at the Santa Anita racetrack.
格雷格告诉我，这场戏是在圣安妮塔赛马场拍的。

2024
01:23:16.230 --> 01:23:20.390
They have a printing room at the Santa Anita racetrack.
圣安妮塔赛马场里有一个印刷室。

2025
01:23:20.910 --> 01:23:26.130
And he said the bigger working machines that you see in the black and white documentary were
他说，你在黑白纪录片里看到的那些体型更大、能运转的机器

2026
01:23:26.130 --> 01:23:30.490
actually filmed at a place called Southwest Offset Printing in Gardenia, California.
实际上是在加州加迪纳一个叫“西南胶印”的地方拍的。

2027
01:23:30.490 --> 01:23:36.910
But this whole thing was inspired by Greg and Michael touring the small newspaper offices.
但这一切的灵感都来自于格雷格和迈克尔参观小型报社办公室的经历。

2028
01:23:36.910 --> 01:23:42.610
He said they went into the basement of one of the buildings and saw these newspaper presses
他说他们走进其中一栋大楼的地下室，看到了这些印刷机

2029
01:23:42.610 --> 01:23:47.190
that were left over from when you actually printed newspapers that way.
那是以前用那种方式印报纸时留下的。

2030
01:23:47.190 --> 01:23:55.330
Michael said that they learned that back in the olden days when they built these buildings and
迈克尔说，他们了解到，在过去建造这些大楼

2031
01:23:55.330 --> 01:24:02.390
these presses that you actually had to embed the press into the foundation of the building
和印刷机时，你实际上必须把印刷机嵌入大楼的地基中

2032
01:24:02.390 --> 01:24:04.670
