01:24:11.870 --> 01:24:13.770
like shook everything in the building.
会把大楼里的所有东西都震动起来。

2035
01:24:13.770 --> 01:24:17.390
So that's why they had to be like literally embedded in the ground.
所以这就是为什么它们必须字面意义上地嵌入地底。

2036
01:24:17.670 --> 01:24:19.190
They are so big.
它们太大了。

2037
01:24:19.350 --> 01:24:24.390
I wanted to do a deep dive, but it would have been a whole episode on the origins of the printing press.
我本来想深入研究一下，但这会变成一整集关于印刷机起源的内容。

2038
01:24:24.630 --> 01:24:31.070
