2054
01:25:19.210 --> 01:25:23.110
So that button down at the end of the machine, that's, well, it's a magic button.
所以机器尽头的那个按钮，那个，嗯，是个神奇的按钮。

2055
01:25:24.820 --> 01:25:29.440
